				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2020 19:01:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Tracque_</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3766847</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I totally respect that:</p> <p>Full disclosure: I ended up at a bit of a crossroads when writing this piece due to the topic. My options were:</p> <ol> <li>Convey an entire journey to the explanation of the SCP, but unfortunately therefore going a lot further into the science and alienating people.</li> <li>Convey none of the journey but gain a great deal of accessibility.</li> </ol> <p>I tried to get a healthy middle ground which I think is OK, but hey: narrative structure is not my forte. I understand your concerns though and thanks for the feedback!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
