					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'll be frank: I'm only posting this because I think I caught a small spelling error:</p> <blockquote> <p>Granted.</p> <p>Foundation front company ██████ will make sizeable donations <strong>the the</strong> science programs of the member states.<br /> - O5-██</p> </blockquote> <p>Did you mean &quot;to the&quot;?</p> 
				 	]]>
